# Sanar, Innovative First-Year: "For each of those colors, you may exile a card of that color from among the revealed cards" is
# one exile (CR 608.2c, 101.4): the card for each color is chosen, then they are exiled together. Laelia, the Blade Reforged
# ("Whenever one or more cards are put into exile from your library and/or your graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on Laelia")
# sees one event and triggers once (CR 603.2c). Bot1 casts Sanar (Black Lotus's Blue, Mox Jet) and Laelia (Mox Ruby, Mox
# Emerald, Mox Pearl) on turn 1; X is 2, blue and red. On turn 3 the trigger reveals Lightning Bolt, Mountain and Counterspell,
# Bot1 exiles Counterspell for blue and the Bolt for red, and Laelia gets one counter: 3/3.

